@bg diggy_kitchen_night
His mom gets home at eleven and hugs you like she's known you forever.
Ms. Williams: So you're London. He talks about you.
Diggy: Ma.
Ms. Williams: He says you're mean.
London: (her friends would say she turned bright red; she would deny it)
Diggy: MA.
